    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d179">

                <pb facs="0152" n="142" xml:id="pg142"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">810.20 Defense/1247</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the Adviser on Political Relations</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Duggan</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Under
                        Secretary of State</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Welles</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1941-07-03">July 3, 1941</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Welles</hi>: Mr. Collado<anchor n="17"
                        xml:id="d179-f1"/> has consulted with me with regard to the negotiation of
                    the basic agreements covering the lease-lend material.</p>
                <p>The negotiation of the twenty agreements will require considerable time and
                    effort on the part of some one person, so that it seems desirable to decide now
                    who will undertake this job. It is obviously desirable that the same person
                    handle all the negotiations.</p>
                <p>At a previous meeting in your office you requested Mr. Acheson to take charge of
                    the preparation of the basic agreements. Would you like him to handle the
                    matter, with proper assistance, or would you prefer that Mr. Bonsal<anchor
                        n="18" xml:id="d179-f2"/> or Mr. Collado undertake the negotiation?<anchor
                        n="19" xml:id="d179-f3"/></p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Laurence Duggan</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
